# A Klingon warship fires on a sensor station, which has no shields, on layouts/destroy.jsonc: its beam shows the hull
# hit sprite (explosion1, a small flare) at the station's hull, at the beam's contact point. The camera is zoomed in
# because the sprite is a few units wide.
# Run it with --layout layouts/destroy.jsonc --fps 30.
scroll up 15
wait 0.2
select Vorcha6
attack Sensor5
wait 0.6
shot hull-1 Sensor5 3
wait 0.3
shot hull-2 Sensor5 3
wait 0.3
shot hull-3 Sensor5 3
dump after
